{"id":"5ec3ed54f5346f98","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-order9-residuation-map.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Residuation Map","display":"df-zfc-order9-residuation-map — ZFC Order9 Residuation Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-residuation-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-residuation-map"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-residuation-map — ZFC Order9 Residuation Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-residuation-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-residuation-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-residuation-map — ZFC Order9 Residuation Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d7a16fc445b65679\" href=\"?note=d7a16fc445b65679\" title=\"58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair\">58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q,f,g\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q,f,g\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ResiduationMap}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ResiduationMap}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}residuation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ResiduationMap}_S(g,f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}residuation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ResiduationMap}_S(g,f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The adjunction equivalence uniquely characterizes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(q)\">\\(g(q)\\)</span> as the greatest <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> satisfying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(p)\\leq_Q q\">\\(f(p)\\leq_Q q\\)</span> whenever the residual exists.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair","status":"resolved","id":"d7a16fc445b65679","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-order11-adjoint-pair]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q,f,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ResiduationMap}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}residuation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9ResiduationMap}_S(g,f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AdjointPair}_S(f,g,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)","display":true},{"tex":"g(q)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"f(p)\\leq_Q q","display":false}],"bytes":889,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2977","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-order9-residuation-map.md|58-df-zfc-order9-residuation-map]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d7a16fc445b65679"]}